@prefix cd: <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

cd:Concept a rdfs:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf skos:Concept .
cd:LearningResource a rdfs:Class .
cd:Definition a rdfs:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf cd:LearningResource .
cd:MathExpression a rdfs:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf cd:LearningResource .
cd:MathSymbol a rdfs:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf cd:LearningResource .
cd:WorkedExample a rdfs:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf cd:LearningResource .
cd:Exercise a rdfs:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf cd:LearningResource .
cd:PitchResource a rdfs:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf cd:LearningResource .
cd:LearningPath a rdfs:Class .
cd:PathStep a rdfs:Class .
cd:Source a rdfs:Class .
cd:PitchSource a rdfs:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf cd:Source .

cd:hasDefinition a rdf:Property ; rdfs:domain cd:Concept ; rdfs:range cd:Definition .
cd:hasMathExpression a rdf:Property ; rdfs:domain cd:Concept ; rdfs:range cd:MathExpression .
cd:hasSymbol a rdf:Property ; rdfs:domain cd:Concept ; rdfs:range cd:MathSymbol .
cd:hasExample a rdf:Property ; rdfs:domain cd:Concept ; rdfs:range cd:WorkedExample .
cd:hasExercise a rdf:Property ; rdfs:domain cd:Concept ; rdfs:range cd:Exercise .
cd:hasSource a rdf:Property ; rdfs:range cd:Source .
cd:sourcePath a rdf:Property ; rdfs:domain cd:PitchSource ; rdfs:range xsd:string .
cd:forTopic a rdf:Property ; rdfs:domain cd:LearningPath ; rdfs:range cd:Concept .
cd:hasStep a rdf:Property ; rdfs:domain cd:LearningPath ; rdfs:range cd:PathStep .
cd:usesResource a rdf:Property ; rdfs:domain cd:PathStep ; rdfs:range cd:LearningResource .
cd:position a rdf:Property ; rdfs:domain cd:PathStep ; rdfs:range xsd:integer .
cd:body a rdf:Property ; rdfs:range rdf:langString .
cd:latex a rdf:Property ; rdfs:range xsd:string .
cd:symbol a rdf:Property ; rdfs:range xsd:string .
cd:viewType a rdf:Property ; rdfs:range xsd:string .
